#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#AEB applies quick and large braking input, when the ACC is not braking quickly enough
#
#The blind spot detection shows alerts for vehicles in the right lane, while the ACC controls the vehicle speed via throttle and brakes using the built-in CarSim speed closed-loop speed control.
#
#The blind spot detection signal includes a low-pass filter that prevents alerts from flashing when oncoming vehicles are detected.
#
#The Weak LKAS tuning setup is selcted here
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

